{%- doc -%}
  MARAMOUR — Popups de talles de la página de producto.
  1. #mm-size-table: tabla de talles (medidas del cuerpo) + guía para medirse + ayuda.
  2. #mm-size-finder: «¿Qué talle soy?» — recomienda un talle con las medidas (según la tabla)
     o con altura, peso y calce preferido. Botón para elegir el talle recomendado.
  Tabla: metacampo del producto custom.tabla_de_talles o la tabla general (una fila por línea,
  columnas con «|», 1.ª fila = títulos, rangos «82 – 86»).
  Se abren con cualquier elemento [data-mm-dialog="id"].

  @param {string} table_src - Texto de la tabla
  @param {string} model_text - Referencia de la modelo
  @param {string} whatsapp_url - Enlace de WhatsApp
  @param {string} whatsapp_label - Número visible
  @param {string} hours - Horario de atención
  @param {string} contact_url - Página de contacto
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  assign rows = table_src | strip | newline_to_br | split: '<br />'
-%}

<dialog class="mm-sheet" id="mm-size-table" aria-labelledby="mm-size-table-title">
  <div class="mm-sheet__panel">
    <button type="button" class="mm-sheet__close" data-mm-close aria-label="Cerrar">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 4l12 12M16 4 4 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="square"/></svg>
    </button>

    <h2 class="mm-sheet__title" id="mm-size-table-title">Tabla de talles</h2>
    <p class="mm-sheet__sub">Medidas del cuerpo, en centímetros.</p>

    <div class="mm-sizes__wrap">
      <table class="mm-sizes">
        {%- for row in rows -%}
          {%- assign cells = row | strip | split: '|' -%}
          {%- if cells.size > 0 -%}
            {%- if forloop.first -%}<thead>{%- endif -%}
            <tr>
              {%- for c in cells -%}
                {%- if forloop.parentloop.first -%}
                  <th scope="col">{{ c | strip | escape }}</th>
                {%- elsif forloop.first -%}
                  <th scope="row">{{ c | strip | escape }}</th>
                {%- else -%}
                  <td>{{ c | strip | escape }}</td>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </tr>
            {%- if forloop.first -%}</thead><tbody>{%- endif -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if forloop.last -%}</tbody>{%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </table>
    </div>

    {%- if model_text != blank -%}
      <p class="mm-sheet__model">{{ model_text | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    <h3 class="mm-sheet__h">Guía de talles</h3>
    <svg class="mm-guide__figure" viewBox="0 0 160 220" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M66 6h28v16H66z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"/>
      <ellipse cx="80" cy="6" rx="14" ry="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"/>
      <path d="M66 22c-2 8-12 12-24 15-12 4-17 14-15 32 2 20 9 31 15 41 4 8 2 16-3 30-6 20-8 40-4 70h90c4-30 2-50-4-70-5-14-7-22-3-30 6-10 13-21 15-41 2-18-3-28-15-32-12-3-22-7-24-15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <ellipse cx="80" cy="70" rx="60" ry="7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"/>
      <ellipse cx="80" cy="120" rx="46" ry="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"/>
      <ellipse cx="80" cy="166" rx="56" ry="7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"/>
      <g fill="currentColor"><circle cx="80" cy="77" r="6"/><circle cx="80" cy="126" r="6"/><circle cx="80" cy="173" r="6"/></g>
      <g fill="#fff" font-size="8" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif"><text x="80" y="80">1</text><text x="80" y="129">2</text><text x="80" y="176">3</text></g>
    </svg>

    <ol class="mm-guide__steps">
      <li><strong>Pecho</strong>Rodeá la espalda con el centímetro, pasándolo por debajo de los brazos y por la parte más ancha del pecho.</li>
      <li><strong>Cintura</strong>Rodeá la cintura con el centímetro, justo por encima del hueso de la cadera.</li>
      <li><strong>Cadera</strong>Con las piernas juntas, rodeá la cadera por la parte más ancha.</li>
    </ol>

    <button type="button" class="mm-sheet__btn" data-mm-dialog="mm-size-finder">Calcular mi talle</button>

    <div class="mm-sheet__help">
      <h3 class="mm-sheet__h">¿Te ayudamos?</h3>
      {%- if whatsapp_url != blank -%}
        <p><a href="{{ whatsapp_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Escribinos por WhatsApp{% if whatsapp_label != blank %} · {{ whatsapp_label | escape }}{% endif %}</a></p>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if hours != blank -%}<p class="mm-sheet__muted">{{ hours | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      {%- if contact_url != blank -%}<p><a href="{{ contact_url }}">Escribinos por mail</a></p>{%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</dialog>

<dialog class="mm-sheet" id="mm-size-finder" aria-labelledby="mm-size-finder-title">
  <div class="mm-sheet__panel">
    <button type="button" class="mm-sheet__close" data-mm-close aria-label="Cerrar">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 4l12 12M16 4 4 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="square"/></svg>
    </button>

    <h2 class="mm-sheet__title" id="mm-size-finder-title">¿Qué talle soy?</h2>
    <p class="mm-sheet__sub">Completá tus datos y te recomendamos un talle.</p>

    <div class="mm-finder__tabs" role="tablist">
      <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-mm-mode="body">Con altura y peso</button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-mm-mode="measures">Con mis medidas</button>
    </div>

    <form class="mm-finder" data-mm-finder novalidate>
      <div class="mm-finder__group" data-mm-group="body">
        <label class="mm-finder__field"><span>Altura</span><input type="number" inputmode="numeric" name="height" min="130" max="210" placeholder="166"><em>cm</em></label>
        <label class="mm-finder__field"><span>Peso</span><input type="number" inputmode="numeric" name="weight" min="35" max="180" placeholder="55"><em>kg</em></label>
        <fieldset class="mm-finder__fit">
          <legend>¿Cómo te gusta que te quede?</legend>
          <label><input type="radio" name="fit" value="-1"><span>Al cuerpo</span></label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="fit" value="0" checked><span>Normal</span></label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="fit" value="1"><span>Holgado</span></label>
        </fieldset>
      </div>

      <div class="mm-finder__group" data-mm-group="measures" hidden>
        <label class="mm-finder__field"><span>Pecho</span><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" name="m1" min="50" max="160" placeholder="84"><em>cm</em></label>
        <label class="mm-finder__field"><span>Cintura</span><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" name="m2" min="40" max="150" placeholder="68"><em>cm</em></label>
        <label class="mm-finder__field"><span>Cadera</span><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" name="m3" min="60" max="170" placeholder="94"><em>cm</em></label>
        <button type="button" class="mm-finder__link" data-mm-dialog="mm-size-table">¿Cómo me mido?</button>
      </div>

      <button type="submit" class="mm-sheet__btn">Ver mi talle</button>
      <p class="mm-finder__error" data-mm-error hidden></p>
    </form>

    <div class="mm-finder__result" data-mm-result hidden>
      <p class="mm-finder__label">Tu talle recomendado</p>
      <p class="mm-finder__size" data-mm-size></p>
      <p class="mm-finder__note" data-mm-note></p>
      <button type="button" class="mm-sheet__btn" data-mm-pick></button>
      <button type="button" class="mm-finder__link" data-mm-again>Volver a calcular</button>
    </div>

    {%- if model_text != blank -%}
      <p class="mm-sheet__model">{{ model_text | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</dialog>

<script>
  (() => {
    if (window.mmSizeDialogs) return;
    window.mmSizeDialogs = true;

    /* Abrir / cerrar popups */
    document.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
      const t = e.target instanceof Element ? e.target : null;
      if (!t) return;
      const opener = t.closest('[data-mm-dialog]');
      if (opener) {
        const d = document.getElementById(opener.dataset.mmDialog);
        if (d instanceof HTMLDialogElement) {
          e.preventDefault();
          document.querySelectorAll('dialog.mm-sheet[open]').forEach((o) => o !== d && o.close());
          if (!d.open) d.showModal();
          document.documentElement.classList.add('mm-sheet-lock');
        }
        return;
      }
      if (t.closest('[data-mm-close]')) t.closest('dialog')?.close();
      else if (t instanceof HTMLDialogElement && t.classList.contains('mm-sheet')) t.close();
    });
    document.querySelectorAll('dialog.mm-sheet').forEach((d) =>
      d.addEventListener('close', () => {
        if (!document.querySelector('dialog.mm-sheet[open]')) document.documentElement.classList.remove('mm-sheet-lock');
      })
    );

    /* Datos de la tabla: talles y rangos por columna */
    const table = document.querySelector('#mm-size-table .mm-sizes');
    const sizes = [];
    const ranges = [];
    table?.querySelectorAll('tbody tr').forEach((tr) => {
      const cells = [...tr.children];
      sizes.push(cells[0].textContent.trim());
      ranges.push(
        cells.slice(1).map((c) => {
          const n = (c.textContent.match(/\d+(?:[.,]\d+)?/g) || []).map((x) => parseFloat(x.replace(',', '.')));
          return n.length ? [Math.min(...n), Math.max(...n)] : null;
        })
      );
    });

    const finder = document.getElementById('mm-size-finder');
    if (!finder || !sizes.length) return;
    const form = finder.querySelector('[data-mm-finder]');
    const result = finder.querySelector('[data-mm-result]');
    const errorEl = finder.querySelector('[data-mm-error]');
    let mode = 'body';

    finder.querySelectorAll('[data-mm-mode]').forEach((tab) =>
      tab.addEventListener('click', () => {
        mode = tab.dataset.mmMode;
        finder.querySelectorAll('[data-mm-mode]').forEach((b) => b.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(b === tab)));
        finder.querySelectorAll('[data-mm-group]').forEach((g) => (g.hidden = g.dataset.mmGroup !== mode));
      })
    );

    const clamp = (i) => Math.max(0, Math.min(sizes.length - 1, i));

    /* Con medidas: el talle cuyo rango incluye la medida; entre dos rangos, el más grande.
       Con varias medidas, gana la que pide el talle más grande (más cómodo). */
    const byMeasures = (values) => {
      let best = -1;
      let outOfRange = false;
      values.forEach((v, col) => {
        if (!v) return;
        let idx = ranges.findIndex((r) => r[col] && v <= r[col][1]);
        if (idx === -1) {
          idx = sizes.length - 1;
          outOfRange = true;
        }
        best = Math.max(best, idx);
      });
      return { idx: best, outOfRange };
    };

    /* Con altura y peso: aproximación por índice de masa corporal, ajustada por calce y altura.
       Referencia: la modelo mide 1,66 m y usa S. */
    const byBody = (h, w, fit) => {
      const bmi = w / Math.pow(h / 100, 2);
      const cuts = [17.5, 19, 21.5, 24, 27, 30];
      let idx = cuts.findIndex((c) => bmi < c);
      if (idx === -1) idx = cuts.length;
      const sIndex = sizes.findIndex((s) => s.toUpperCase() === 'XXS') === 0 ? 0 : 1;
      idx = idx - sIndex;
      if (h >= 176 && idx < 3) idx += 1;
      return clamp(idx + fit);
    };

    form.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      errorEl.hidden = true;
      const fd = new FormData(form);
      let idx = -1;
      let note = '';
      if (mode === 'body') {
        const h = parseFloat(fd.get('height'));
        const w = parseFloat(fd.get('weight'));
        if (!(h >= 130 && h <= 210) || !(w >= 35 && w <= 180)) {
          errorEl.textContent = 'Completá tu altura (en cm) y tu peso (en kg).';
          errorEl.hidden = false;
          return;
        }
        idx = byBody(h, w, parseInt(fd.get('fit') || '0', 10));
        note = 'Recomendación aproximada. Para más precisión, calculalo con tus medidas.';
      } else {
        const vals = ['m1', 'm2', 'm3'].map((k) => parseFloat(String(fd.get(k) || '').replace(',', '.')) || 0);
        if (!vals.some(Boolean)) {
          errorEl.textContent = 'Completá al menos una medida.';
          errorEl.hidden = false;
          return;
        }
        const r = byMeasures(vals);
        idx = r.idx;
        note = r.outOfRange
          ? 'Tus medidas superan nuestra tabla: escribinos y te asesoramos.'
          : 'Según la tabla de talles. Si estás entre dos talles, elegí el más grande.';
      }
      const size = sizes[clamp(idx)];
      finder.querySelector('[data-mm-size]').textContent = size;
      finder.querySelector('[data-mm-note]').textContent = note;
      const pick = finder.querySelector('[data-mm-pick]');
      pick.textContent = `Elegir talle ${size}`;
      pick.dataset.size = size;
      form.hidden = true;
      result.hidden = false;
    });

    finder.querySelector('[data-mm-again]').addEventListener('click', () => {
      result.hidden = true;
      form.hidden = false;
    });

    finder.querySelector('[data-mm-pick]').addEventListener('click', (e) => {
      const size = e.currentTarget.dataset.size;
      finder.close();
      const input = [...document.querySelectorAll('.mm-opt--text input[type="radio"]')].find((i) => i.value === size);
      if (!input) return;
      input.closest('label')?.click();
      input.closest('fieldset')?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
    });
  })();
</script>

{% stylesheet %}
  .mm-sheet-lock {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .mm-sheet [hidden] {
    display: none !important;
  }

  .mm-sheet {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 560px;
    height: 100%;
    max-height: none;
    margin: 0 0 0 auto;
    padding: 0;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    background: var(--color-background, #fff);
    border: 0;
  }

  .mm-sheet::backdrop {
    background: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.4);
  }

  .mm-sheet[open] {
    animation: mm-sheet-in 0.28s ease;
  }

  @keyframes mm-sheet-in {
    from {
      transform: translateX(24px);
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .mm-sheet[open] {
      animation: none;
    }
  }

  .mm-sheet__panel {
    position: relative;
    height: 100%;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 56px var(--page-margin, 20px) 40px;
    overscroll-behavior: contain;
  }

  .mm-sheet__close {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10px;
    right: 8px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    padding: 0;
    color: inherit;
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .mm-sheet__close svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
  }

  .mm-sheet__title {
    margin: 0 0 4px;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .mm-sheet__sub,
  .mm-sheet__muted {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.65);
  }

  .mm-sheet__h {
    margin: 32px 0 14px;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .mm-sizes__wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin-inline: calc(var(--page-margin, 20px) * -1);
    padding-inline: var(--page-margin, 20px);
  }

  .mm-sizes {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .mm-sizes th,
  .mm-sizes td {
    padding: 14px 8px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .mm-sizes thead th {
    font-weight: 500;
    white-space: normal;
    color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.75);
  }

  .mm-sizes tbody tr:nth-child(odd) {
    background: #f3f3f3;
  }

  .mm-sizes tbody th {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .mm-sheet__model {
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    background: #f9e3e8;
    color: #6d2440;
  }

  .mm-guide__figure {
    display: block;
    width: 150px;
    height: auto;
    margin: 0 auto 8px;
  }

  .mm-guide__steps {
    margin: 0;
    padding-inline-start: 20px;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .mm-guide__steps li + li {
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .mm-guide__steps strong {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .mm-sheet__btn {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 50px;
    margin-top: 24px;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #fff;
    background: #111;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 4px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .mm-sheet__help {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .mm-sheet__help p {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .mm-sheet__help a {
    color: inherit;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  /* Recomendador */
  .mm-finder__tabs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.12);
  }

  .mm-finder__tabs button {
    padding: 12px 4px;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.55);
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
    margin-bottom: -1px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .mm-finder__tabs [aria-selected='true'] {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    border-bottom-color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .mm-finder__group {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .mm-finder__field {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 80px minmax(0, 1fr) 28px;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .mm-finder__field input {
    min-width: 0;
    height: 46px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: inherit;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.2);
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .mm-finder__field em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.6);
  }

  .mm-finder__fit {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
  }

  .mm-finder__fit legend {
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .mm-finder__fit label {
    position: relative;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .mm-finder__fit input {
    position: absolute;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .mm-finder__fit span {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 9px 14px;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.2);
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .mm-finder__fit input:checked + span {
    color: #fff;
    background: #111;
    border-color: #111;
  }

  .mm-finder__fit input:focus-visible + span {
    outline: 2px solid currentColor;
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .mm-finder__link {
    justify-self: start;
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding: 4px 0;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .mm-finder__error {
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: #b3261e;
  }

  .mm-finder__result {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    padding: 12px 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .mm-finder__label {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.65);
  }

  .mm-finder__size {
    margin: 6px 0;
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .mm-finder__result .mm-finder__link {
    justify-self: center;
  }

  .mm-finder__note {
    max-width: 34ch;
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.7);
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
